 "about": "PENDING FOR THE SIGNER (limits.rs does not pass these yet; its test reads limits.json only). More of what a connection of an outside app is never given: app data under the belfry's names (kind 30078, a d tag starting belfry:), labels in the belfry's namespaces (kind 1985, an L tag or an l tag's mark that is belfry or starts belfry/), and decrypting without a consent flag on the connection (`methods`: `decrypt` is the connection's flag). Kind 5 stays allowed. remoteapps.py passes them today (tests/test_own_mode.py); when limits.rs does, move the cases into limits.json and delete this file.",
